ood pressure was 117/89 and he weighed 93 pounds. He continues on leuprolide 7.5 mg for his known Prostate adenocarcinoma, high grade (Gleason 9), with no evidence of disease progression.\n\nApril 06, 2022: Mr. Walker was seen today follow-up on his Prostate adenocarcinoma, high grade. His blood pressure was 120/84 and he weighed 103 pounds. His Gleason score is 9 and he has had no signs of recurrence since his treatment, which took place about 3.6 years ago.\n"
